                <mxCell id="30" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;_tech_map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;font-size: 23px; line-height: 60%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: normal; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The tech map is usually defined by the model system it maps unique generator ids to technologies or prime mover types.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#000000;labelBorderColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
